{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-85-1","title":"Psalms 85:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":85,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":85,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The Psalmist, out of the experience of former mercies, prays for the continuance thereof. 8 He promises to wait thereon, out of confidence of God's goodness.</p>\n<p>A.M. 3468. B.C. 536. (Title.) for. or, of. 42:1; *title Lord. Le 26:42; Joe 2:18; Zec 1:16 favourable unto. or, well pleased with. 77:7 thou hast. 14:7; 126:1,2; Ezr 1:11; 2:1; Jer 30:18; 31:23; Eze 39:25; Joe 3:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-85-2","title":"Psalms 85:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":85,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":85,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>forgiven. 32:1; 79:8,9; Jer 50:20; Mic 7:18; Ac 13:39; Col 2:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-85-3","title":"Psalms 85:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":85,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":85,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>taken. Isa 6:7; 12:1; 54:7-10; Joh 1:29 turned, etc. or, turned thine anger from waxing hot. Ex 32:11,22; De 13:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-85-4","title":"Psalms 85:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":85,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":85,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>turn us.The Israelites were not restored from their captivity all at once: a few returned with Zerubbabel, some more with Ezra and Nehemiah; but a great number still remained in Babylonia, Media, Assyria, etc.; and therefore the Psalmist prays for a complete restoration.</p>\n<p>80:3,7,19; Jer 31:18; La 5:21; Mal 4:6 O God. 25:2; 27:1; Mic 7:7,18-20; Joh 4:22 cause. 78:38; Isa 10:25; Da 9:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-85-5","title":"Psalms 85:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":85,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":85,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>angry. 74:1; 77:9; 79:5; 80:4; 89:46; Isa 64:9-12; Mic 7:18 draw. Lu 21:24; Re 18:21-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-85-6","title":"Psalms 85:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":85,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":85,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>revive. 80:18; 138:7; Ezr 9:8,9; Isa 57:15; Ho 6:2; Hab 3:2 people. 53:6; Ezr 3:11-13; Jer 33:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-85-7","title":"Psalms 85:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":85,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":85,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>50:23; 91:16; Jer 42:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-85-8","title":"Psalms 85:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":85,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":85,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>hear. Hab 2:1; Heb 12:25 for he. 29:11; Isa 57:19; Zec 9:10; Joh 14:27; 20:19,26; Ac 10:36 2Co 5:18-20; Eph 2:17; 2Th 3:16 to his. 50:5; Eph 1:1,2 but. 130:4; Joh 5:14; 8:11; Ac 3:26; Ga 4:9; 2Ti 2:19; Heb 10:26-29 2Pe 2:20-22; Re 2:4,5; 3:19 folly. Ge 34:7; 1Sa 25:25; Pr 25:11; 27:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-85-9","title":"Psalms 85:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":85,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":85,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Surely. 24:4,5; 50:23; 119:155; Isa 46:13; Mr 12:32-34; Joh 7:17; Ac 10:2-4 Ac 11:13,14; 13:16 glory. Isa 4:5; Eze 26:20; Hag 2:7-9; Zec 2:5,8; Lu 2:32; Joh 1:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-85-10","title":"Psalms 85:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":85,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":85,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Mercy. 89:14; 100:5; Ex 34:6,7; Mic 7:20; Lu 1:54,55; Joh 1:17 righteousness. 72:3; Isa 32:16-18; 45:24; Jer 23:5,6; Lu 2:14; Ro 3:25,26; 5:1,21 Heb 7:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-85-11","title":"Psalms 85:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":85,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":85,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Truth. Isa 4:2; 45:8; 53:2; Joh 14:6; 1Jo 5:20,21 righteousness. Isa 42:21; Mt 3:17; 17:5; Lu 2:14; 2Co 5:21; Eph 1:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-85-12","title":"Psalms 85:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":85,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":85,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>the Lord. 84:11; Mic 6:8; 1Co 1:30; Eph 1:3; Jas 1:17 our land. 67:6; 72:16; Isa 30:23,24; 32:15; Mt 13:8,23; Ac 2:41; 21:20; *Gr: 1Co 3:6-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-85-13","title":"Psalms 85:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":85,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":85,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Righteousness. 72:2,3; 89:14; Isa 58:8 shall set. 119:35; Mt 20:27,28; Joh 13:14-16,34; 2Co 3:18; Ga 2:20; Eph 5:1,2 Php 2:5-8; Heb 12:1,2; 1Pe 2:18-24; 4:1; 1Jo 2:6</p>"}]}